   Peiro-Palomino, Jesus, Univ Valencia, Dept Appl Econ 2, Valencia, Spain.
   Peiro-Palomino, Jesus, Univ Valencia, INTECO, Valencia, Spain.
   Tortosa-Ausina, Emili, Univ Jaume 1, Dept Econ, IIDL, Castellon de La Plana, Spain.
   Tortosa-Ausina, Emili, Univ Jaume 1, Ivie, Castellon de La Plana, Spain.},
