Abstract = {This paper employs data envelopment analysis (DEA) to study
   intergovernmental transfers of revenue from central to local government,
   termed local aid in the Commonwealth of Massachusetts. The pattern of
   transfers is evaluated relative to DEA efficiency measures. The
